Z||000014||mdjoneses||08-20-2000||09:50 PM||||Thanks for everyones help the car is running 100 percent !! We were about to install new fuel injectors cause we figured they were clogged after the 10 years storage. We tried to start it first and it ran a couple seconds longer. Then again it kept running but very ruff.  We adjusted the timing and still ruff. We were still happy not to spend $300. bucks and our labor. At the last minute we found we had forgot to put a small vacuum line back onto the MAP sensor. After we fixed that it smoothed out and ran like brand new !!     Mark86se-w/49400miles/2.8<BR>.||||reg||10
Z||000015||mdjoneses||08-20-2000||10:10 PM|||| Thanks for everyones help the car is running 100 percent !! We were about to install new fuel injectors cause we figured they were clogged after the 10 years storage. We tried to start it first and it ran a couple seconds longer. Then again it kept running but very ruff.  We adjusted the timing and still ruff. We were still happy not to spend $300. bucks and our labor. At the last minute we found we had forgot to put a small vacuum line back onto the MAP sensor. After we fixed that it smoothed out and ran like brand new !!     Mark86se-w/49400miles/2.8||||reg||10
